01:52:19,640 --> 01:52:24,560
 we achieve a clear understanding of ourselves and we achieve clarity of thought and therefore

1607
01:52:24,560 --> 01:52:29,400
 become more articulate when we engage in consistent output.

1608
01:52:29,400 --> 01:52:34,920
 Now output can be writing, it can be conversations, it can be recording, videos, voice notes.

1609
01:52:34,920 --> 01:52:40,120
 The modern media world likes to dictate that we should have all of these clear answers

1610
01:52:40,120 --> 01:52:41,440
 every time we speak.

1611
01:52:41,440 --> 01:52:46,000
 We see people online speaking, these mic drop moments, all the short clips of people spraying

1612
01:52:46,000 --> 01:52:49,840
 wisdom and we feel like we should be able to do the same in some regard.

