01:54:20,800 --> 01:54:23,640
 Now, it doesn't mean that it's right, it doesn't mean that you're understanding of everything

1635
01:54:23,640 --> 01:54:27,320
 is right, but it does mean that you understand it and can explain it.

1636
01:54:27,320 --> 01:54:32,280
 And this is what we describe as a bulletproof, golden-tongued speaker.

1637
01:54:32,280 --> 01:54:37,360
 And in my mind, only five people in the world who are at this level, who have refined

1638
01:54:37,360 --> 01:54:41,680
 their thinking through a tremendous amount of output.

1639
01:54:41,680 --> 01:54:45,000
 Okay, so output produces clarity.

