01:54:57,880 --> 01:55:00,440
 There's a simplicity to their sentences.

1645
01:55:00,440 --> 01:55:05,480
 In fact, one of the things that we've studied is the science of clear communication.

1646
01:55:05,480 --> 01:55:11,520
 And we found that in the clear speakers in the world, their flow of information is usually

1647
01:55:11,520 --> 01:55:14,720
 limited to one idea per sentence.

1648
01:55:14,720 --> 01:55:21,840
 We've mastered this moving forward of an idea at a very digestible pace.

1649
01:55:21,840 --> 01:55:27,320
 And when each sentence moves the idea forward, there's no redundancy.

1650
01:55:27,320 --> 01:55:28,320
 The idea feels lean.

