 The clarity of a philosopher like this begins with getting your mind's inner contents outside.

1675
01:56:39,000 --> 01:56:42,960
 So in these final few minutes together, what I want to do is give you a few practices

1676
01:56:42,960 --> 01:56:46,520
 that you can start today to instantly enrich your speaking.

1677
01:56:46,520 --> 01:56:49,480
 The first is to reduce erosion tags.

1678
01:56:49,480 --> 01:56:55,480
 Errosion tags are weak phrases that we often tag to the end of our sentences that taper

1679
01:56:55,480 --> 01:56:56,800
 off the discussion.

