01:57:15,000 --> 01:57:16,800
 our speech.

1686
01:57:16,800 --> 01:57:19,640
 But that's just my opinion.

1687
01:57:19,640 --> 01:57:26,560
 To see how a weak ending can undermine the integrity of your entire idea.

