01:57:58,320 --> 01:58:03,080
 The next one is to commit to completing each sentence.

1697
01:58:03,080 --> 01:58:08,080
 The lack of direction in our speaking, the winding sort of scattered nature of a lot of our

1698
01:58:08,080 --> 01:58:14,600
 thoughts is actually the result of us giving ourselves permission to abandon a sentence.

