01:58:17,800 --> 01:58:23,160
 In fact, if you develop the practice of forcing yourself to work with the words you've spoken

1701
01:58:23,160 --> 01:58:28,200
 aloud, what you do is you improve your mind's verbal agility with words.

1702
01:58:28,200 --> 01:58:30,920
 And you realize that you can kind of make anything work.

1703
01:58:30,920 --> 01:58:37,160
 The next technique, keep your mouth closed until you've defined your starting words.

